  Placement: 1
  CardStory: "2Spade comes in for debrief this morning, and he gets the feeling that
    the Sergeant is off.\r\nMaybe the stress. *She sits behind the table, I think.
    I see her eyes there.* \r\n\r\n2Spade feels like not everyone is genuine, and
    lets her know. A lot of accusations towards superiors and rivals. Getting competition
    out of the way. *Sergeant 6Spade thanks me for his report.* 2Spade sees her reflection
    on the polished wood.\r\n\r\nHave her eyes always been this big?\r\n\r\n*Of course,
    I think. Why wouldn\u2019t they? I\u2019ve heard it say that she\u2019s got an
    eye for the battlefield.* 2Spade shakes his head and reel for a moment. Ah, that
    must be it, 2Spade thinks. An eye for the battlefield. Right on. He must be getting
    forgetful again.\r\n\r\nSergeant 6Spade smiles. 2Spade smiles. \r\n\r\n*The corners
    of my mouth move upwards.*"
